            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-forest mb-4">1. Information We Collect</h2>
            <p class="mb-6">When you book a tour or request a quote through Safar Saathi, we may collect personal information including your name, email address, phone number, and travel preferences. We use this information solely to facilitate your bookings and improve our services.</p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-forest mb-4">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
            <p class="mb-6">Your data is used to process your inquiries, arrange homestay bookings, and provide customer support. We may occasionally send updates regarding your trip or new tour packages.</p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-forest mb-4">3. Data Sharing</h2>
            <p class="mb-6">We respect your privacy. We do not sell your personal information to third parties. Your details are only shared with our verified partner hoteliers and transport providers to fulfill your specific booking requests.</p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-forest mb-4">4. Security</h2>
            <p class="mb-6">We implement standard security protocols to ensure your data is protected against unauthorized access.</p>
            
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-forest mb-4">5. Contact Us</h2>
            <p>If you have any questions about our Privacy Policy, please email us at <a href="mailto:darjeelingecotour@gmail.com" class="text-primary hover:underline">darjeelingecotour@gmail.com</a>.</p>
